\strong{This is a screen, not a decision rule.} A covariate that is not flagged has not been shown to be
unaffected by the treatment: the test has the same limited power as the outcome test. A flagged covariate may
be a mediator or a confounder; the test cannot tell which. Plot the trajectories with
\code{\link[=plot_covariate_trajectories]{plot_covariate_trajectories()}} and decide from what is known about the case.

Takes well under a second per covariate; no \code{fect}.
